<title>GREECE: BASKETBALL-WUPPERTAL WIN WOMEN'S EUROLEAGUE SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WUPPERTAL WIN WOMEN'S EUROLEAGUE SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LARISSA, Greece 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wuppertal (Germany) beat Ruzomberok (Slovakia) 86-66 (halftime 45-33) in a women's EuroLeague basketball semifinal match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Wuppertal - Sandra Brondello 23, Petra Kremer 19, Marlise Askamp 19</p>
<p>Ruzomberok - Elena Jirko 20, Iveta Bielikova 15, Renata Hirakova 12</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,800</p>
<p>Second semifinal to be played later today between Bourge (France) and Como (Italy). Final will be held on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Add semifinals</p>
<p>Bourges (France) beat Como (Italy) 68-58 (32-24)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bourges - Anna Kotokova 20, Yannick Souvre 18, Isabelle Fijalkowski 10</p>
<p>Como - Catarina Pollini 14, Andrea Congreaves 13, Bridgitte Gordon 10</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,200</p>
<p>Final: Bourges v Wuppertal (Thursday)</p>
</text>
